    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put it... \"letting go of the space\"... it's like you actually understand. it feels like there's this heavy debt i carry every day just by breathing. like i'm just consuming resources and love that should have gone to them instead. if i wasn't here, wouldn't the world just feel more balanced?",
